AcceptanceCriteria.Criterion:
src/review/{core,catalog,command}.ts exist; ngrace review registered on grace.ts;
review.* codes only in review catalog; runLint emits zero review.*; review surface
can emit review.* on a fixture (A7.2 both directions). Does not write Verdicts or status.

Scorer runs corpus() multi-surface; each entry scored before and after apply() (A36.3);
reports per-pattern and per-surface rates, both directions. Process-audit codes not in
expected rows do not inflate pattern rates.
